        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "text": "The engineer's suit is a very useful piece of safety equipment for the daily maintenance of factories.\n\nThe set offers decent protection and has a low production cost, but its best attributes are not limited to just that.",
          "y": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "components": [
        {
          "template": "modopedia:page/headered_text",
          "header": "Thermal Insulation",
          "text": "The set has protection against temperature changes caused by blocks and the environment, thus preventing you from fainting near machines that produce a lot of heat.\n\nThe rubber boots increase movement speed by 10%, swimming speed by 20%, and reduce fall damage by 50%."
